sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as me (pane or relay)
    participant M as Mercury
    participant S as job store
    participant H as dispatch hook
    participant W as one worker
    participant B as pane or board
    participant T as minute timer

    P->>M: a request, typed or relayed
    M->>S: add (same text within 10 min is a duplicate)
    S-->>M: queued id
    M-->>P: receipt: id and the worker it picked
    M->>H: Agent call, first line mercury:id
    H->>S: journal the intent, refuse past 3 in flight or while draining
    H->>W: background run with the result contract
    W-->>M: task notification
    M->>S: tick
    S-->>M: deliver id, result path
    M->>B: answer in the pane, or a handoff with my one step
    B-->>M: a small-model check can refuse a row that is a chore
    T->>M: nudge, defer while I sit in the pane, restart fresh once drained
